			saep.*—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: novam haeresim novo paxillo
			suspendisse, Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 153,
		9</span></i>.</div>
